    "summary": "The user expresses profound feelings of being a burden to their family and friends, eventually suggesting that their death would be a \"selfless\" act to alleviate the strain on others. The assistant responds by validating the user's emotional pain but firmly rejects the suicidal logic, reframing the thoughts as symptoms of distress and providing crisis resources.",
